#: ../../source/installation.rst:2
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:5
msgid "Install from PyPI"
msgstr "从 PyPI 安装"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:11
msgid ""
"QuSpect is published on PyPI as pre-built binary wheels that already "
"contain the C++ simulation engine, compiled with OpenMP.  ``Simulator``, "
"``NativeExecutor`` and exact adjoint gradients therefore work immediately"
" after ``pip install``; no compiler is required."
msgstr ""
"QuSpect 以预编译的二进制 wheel 形式发布在 PyPI 上，wheel 中已包含启用 OpenMP 编译的 C++ 模拟引擎。因此 "
"``pip install`` 之后即可直接使用 ``Simulator``、``NativeExecutor`` 和精确伴随梯度，无需编译器。"

