#: ../../source/installation.rst:48
msgid "Installing from source"
msgstr "从源码安装"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:50
msgid ""
"On any other platform -- for example musl-based distributions such as "
"Alpine, 32-bit Windows, Intel Macs, macOS older than 14, or PyPy -- "
"``pip`` falls back to the source distribution and compiles the C++ "
"extension locally.  This requires:"
msgstr ""
"在其他任何平台上——例如 Alpine 等基于 musl 的发行版、32 位 Windows、Intel Mac、低于"
" 14 的 macOS 或 PyPy——``pip`` 会退回到源码包并在本地编译 C++ 扩展。这需要："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:54
msgid ""
"CMake 3.22 or newer and a C++17 compiler: Visual Studio Build Tools on "
"Windows, the Xcode Command Line Tools on macOS (plus ``brew install "
"libomp`` for OpenMP support), or GCC / Clang on Linux;"
msgstr ""
"CMake 3.22 及以上和 C++17 编译器：Windows 上为 Visual Studio Build Tools，macOS 上为 "
"Xcode Command Line Tools（OpenMP 支持需另外 ``brew install libomp``），Linux 上为 "
"GCC / Clang；"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:57
msgid ""
"network access during the build, to fetch the header-only nlohmann/json "
"library."
msgstr "构建期间需要网络，用于获取仅头文件的 nlohmann/json 库。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:61
msgid "Runtime configuration"
msgstr "运行时配置"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:63
msgid "``QUSPECT_DISABLE_AVX2``"
msgstr "``QUSPECT_DISABLE_AVX2``"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:64
msgid ""
"On x86_64 the wheel ships two extension modules: a portable scalar build "
"and an AVX2 + FMA build.  The AVX2 module is loaded only when the CPU and"
" operating system support AVX2 and FMA.  Set ``QUSPECT_DISABLE_AVX2=1`` "
"to force the scalar kernels.  The variable is read once, the first time "
"the native backend is loaded."
msgstr ""
"在 x86_64 上，wheel 包含两个扩展模块：可移植的标量版本和 AVX2 + FMA 版本。只有当 CPU 和操作系统都支持 AVX2 与"
" FMA 时才会加载 AVX2 模块。设置 ``QUSPECT_DISABLE_AVX2=1`` "
"可强制使用标量内核。该变量只在首次加载原生后端时读取一次。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:70
msgid "``OMP_NUM_THREADS``"
msgstr "``OMP_NUM_THREADS``"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:71
msgid ""
"The parallel kernels use OpenMP.  Set ``OMP_NUM_THREADS`` to limit the "
"number of threads."
msgstr "并行内核基于 OpenMP。设置 ``OMP_NUM_THREADS`` 可限制线程数。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:74
msgid "Check which backend is active:"
msgstr "查看当前使用的后端："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:81
msgid "Detecting the native core"
msgstr "检测原生核心"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:83
msgid ""
"Use :func:`quspect.native.load_core` to check whether the C++ native core"
" is available.  It is the supported, stable public way to detect the "
"native core and never raises when the extension is simply missing: it "
"returns ``None`` when the native core has not been built, and the loaded "
"extension module otherwise.  Treat the returned module only as an "
"availability signal; its name (``quspect._core_scalar`` or "
"``quspect._core_avx2``) is an implementation detail."
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`quspect.native.load_core` 检查 C++ "
"原生核心是否可用。这是检测原生核心的受支持且稳定的公开方式，仅在扩展缺失时不会抛出异常：未构建原生核心时返回 "
"``None``，否则返回已加载的扩展模块。请仅将返回的模块视为可用性信号；其模块名（``quspect._core_scalar`` 或 "
"``quspect._core_avx2``）属于实现细节。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:101
msgid "Development install"
msgstr "开发安装"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:110
msgid ""
"The editable install is pure Python and does not compile the C++ "
"extension. Build it into the local ``quspect/`` package with CMake:"
msgstr "可编辑安装是纯 Python 的，不会编译 C++ 扩展。请用 CMake 将扩展构建到本地 ``quspect/`` 包中："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:120
msgid "Pass ``-DQSPECT_BUILD_AVX2=OFF`` for a scalar-only build."
msgstr "如果只需要标量实现，可传入 ``-DQSPECT_BUILD_AVX2=OFF``。"

